WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.073
Today we will use evidence to discuss a performance. Our work connects with selected

00:00:05.073 --> 00:00:06.813
artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.617 --> 00:00:12.658
Watch or listen carefully without interrupting. Name a design choice that a selected

00:00:12.658 --> 00:00:14.209
Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:18.319
Record one strength in timing, expression or teamwork.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.443
Suggest one useful change and say how to rehearse it.
